{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["All the 'alufim' in this pericloud are chiefs of towns and clans. And Korah the 'aluf' mentioned among the sons of Eliphaz — it appears to me that he is Timna, who is listed among the sons of Eliphaz in Chronicles, since among the sons of Oholivamah there is another Korah."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:19.264450097Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}